- **Description:**  "Facebook login” fails with broken “link error" during “checkout".

- **Steps to Reproduce:**  
  1. Open the app
  2. Add 3 products to cart
  3. Click on checkout
  4. Click on login/registration(Anmelden / Registrieren)
  5. Click login with Facebook
  6. Enter valid Facebook credentials and submit 

- **Expected Result:** User enters valid Facebook credentials and is logged in successfully, then returned to the checkout flow with their Facebook account linked, allowing them to continue the purchase.​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​
- **Actual Result:** User is shown a Facebook error page stating “The link you followed may be broken, or the page may have been removed” instead of being logged in. Login does not complete and user is not returned to checkout. Issue is consistently reproducible. Apple login on the same checkout flow completed successfully, confirming the issue is isolated to Facebook login specifically.​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​​
